OL,3,GNEWSAThree arrested after man shot near
OL,4,Acity venue
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree people have been arrested after a
OL,7,Fman was shot in Birmingham following
OL,8,Fdisorder at an events venue.
OL,10,FPolice were called shortly before 23:20
OL,11,FBST on Sunday to Luna Springs on Lower
OL,12,FTrinity Street, Digbeth, following
OL,13,Freports of a gun being fired on the
OL,14,Fcorner of Hack Street and Bromley
OL,15,FStreet.
OL,17,FDet Insp Stacey Follows, from West
OL,18,FMidlands Police Major Crime Unit, said:
OL,19,F"It's believed the disorder started
OL,20,Finside the venue and then spilled out
OL,21,Fon to the street, where the shooting
OL,22,Fhappened."
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
