OL,3,GNEWSAThree arrested after man shot near
OL,4,Acity venue
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man aged 23 suffered a gunshot wound
OL,7,Fto the leg and remains under arrest in
OL,8,Fhospital on suspicion of violent
OL,9,Fdisorder. Two other men, aged 20 and
OL,10,F30, have also been detained.
